@startuml
title 预约标题：顺序、上限和重复检查
actor Reader as A
participant ReaderController as C
participant ReservationService as S
participant ReaderRepository as Readers
participant BookTitleRepository as Titles
participant ReservationRepository as Reservations
participant Reader as R
participant BookTitle as T
participant Reservation as Q
A -> C : reserve(titleId)
C -> S : reserve(actor, request)
S -> S : authorize / begin transaction / lock
S -> Readers : find actor reader
alt 读者不存在
 S --> C : READER_NOT_FOUND
else 读者存在
 S -> R : assert active and valid card
 S -> Titles : find title
 alt 标题不存在或停用
  S --> C : TITLE_NOT_FOUND
 else 有效标题
  S -> T : check reservable
  S -> Reservations : find active(readerId, titleId)
  alt 重复预约
   S --> C : DUPLICATE_RESERVATION (rollback)
  else 已有5个有效预约
   S --> C : RESERVATION_LIMIT (rollback)
  else 有可直接借副本
   S --> C : ITEM_AVAILABLE (rollback)
  else 可以排队
   S -> Reservations : next queue_no under lock
   S -> Q : create WAITING at current instant
   S -> Reservations : save
   note right of Reservations : 同标题按 (created_at,id) 排序
queue_no 单调递增，不复用取消序号
   S -> S : audit / commit
   S --> C : ReservationView
  end
 end
end
C --> A : HTTP response
@enduml
